Package: slaps-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: PriCoSoft GmbH <noreply@pricosoft.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.6), openssl, passwd, systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://www.pricosoft.com/
Description: Standalone LAPS (SLAPS) agent
 Rotates the password of a local account (root by default) and backs it up,
 encrypted for the SLAPS recovery certificate, to the SLAPS server over HTTPS
 with a client certificate. Enroll with a client package from the SLAPS
 portal: sudo sh install.sh
